# Processor Icon Placeholder
# This is a placeholder file for the processor-style app icon
# Replace with actual PNG generated from the SVG or created in a graphics editor
# 
# For now, copy your existing icon.png and apply processor-style overlay:
# 1. Dark background with gradient
# 2. Central processor die with gold border
# 3. Copper connection grid inside
# 4. Gold connection pads around perimeter
# 5. Route arrow in center
# 6. Small components (resistors/capacitors) scattered around
#
# Recommended tools:
# - Figma (free, web-based)
# - Adobe Illustrator
# - Sketch
